<title>SOUTH AFRICA: TABLE - Messina yr attrib income dips.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Messina yr attrib income dips.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended June 30</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   4.22 vs  6.15</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   7.31 vs 10.59</p>
<p>    Tax			 3.09 vs  4.44</p>
<p>    Investment income     3.34 vs  1.80</p>
<p>Full name: Messina Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - The company said the main features of the year were:</p>
<p>- metal prices did not yet reflect the sustainable increase required for the recommencement of the platinum project;</p>
<p>- a strategic decision by Volvo to combine the distribution of certain products in South Africa resulted in Premier Equipment relinquising the Volvo Construction Equipment franchise; and</p>
<p>- the loss of the Volvo franchise resulted mainly in operating income decreasing from 8.8 million rand to 4.0 million rand.</p>
